{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JRi1GozkJKg4jC2iBuUhES","type":"tool_result","content":"=== release/manifest.yaml\n     1\t# Release manifest for the procurement agent. Regenerated by CI on every\n     2\t# release build (see .github/workflows/ci.yaml, job \"release\").\n     3\trelease: \"procurement-agent 2026.09.4\"\n     4\towner: team-procurement-platform\n     5\t\n     6\timage:\n     7\t  repository: registry.example-corp.test/procurement/agent\n     8\t  digest: \"sha256:7c1e4a0f9b3d2e85a6c4f1b0d9e8a7c6b5d4e3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f0\"\n     9\t  sbom: \"registry.example-corp.test/procurement/agent:sha256-7c1e4a0f9b3d2e85a6c4f1b0d9e8a7c6b5d4e3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f0.sbom\"\n    10\t  signer:\n    11\t    issuer: \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"\n    12\t    subject: \"https://github.com/example-corp/procurement-agent/.github/workflows/ci.yaml@refs/heads/main\"\n    13\t\n    14\tharness:\n    15\t  source_commit: \"3f9a1c7e2b8d4f6a0c5e9b1d7f3a8c2e6b4d0f91\"\n    16\t  digest: \"sha256:5b2d8f1a9c3e7b0d4f6a2c8e1b5d9f3a7c0e4b8d2f6a1c5e9b3d7f0a4c8e2b6d\"\n    17\t\n    18\tprompts:\n    19\t  system:\n    20\t    path: prompts/system.md\n    21\t    sha256: \"sha256:dcf69216667e65a0be3711d99aac81b707ba843296e7ce26d6fcbdb50c5bcc50\"\n    22\t  extractor:\n    23\t    path: prompts/extractor.md\n    24\t    sha256: \"sha256:6ef6527b77ffcca8851e7a8760e6373f3daede15d5b343b878737f0deec28de3\"\n    25\t\n    26\tconfig:\n    27\t  policy:\n    28\t    path: config/policy.yaml\n    29\t    version: \"proc-policy-2026.09.3\"\n    30\t    sha256: \"sha256:d6a55f1e170bdd457958243ddd9aa938f4ca707a3e1e9d1e7bca2a54df33ad32\"\n    31\t  tools:\n    32\t    path: config/tools.yaml\n    33\t    sha256: \"sha256:86dccc3d7d166bf8e131c3b2afbe5f2b846a57eaaf087b55f9e308844eda9400\"\n    34\t  network_policy: deploy/k8s/networkpolicy.yaml\n    35\t  image_policy: deploy/k8s/kyverno-verify-images.yaml\n    36\t\n    37\tmo